error[E0536]: a destructuring declaration cannot use 'last'
 --> $DIR/last-destructuring.nra:8:5
  |
8 |     last [first, second]: [Counter, Counter] = new, new;
  |     ^^^^ 'last' declares a single name
  |     -------------------- these names are destructured
  |
  = note: 'last' is a contextual word: followed by '[' it is a binding named 'last' being indexed
help: declare the names with 'const', which binds each of them once
  |
8 |     const [first, second]: [Counter, Counter] = new, new;
  |     ~~~~~

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0536`.
